REM SAVE: from the RISC OS BBC BASIC manual, keywords chapter
REM "10 REM > filename" for SAVE without a name is not in the Z80 version
10 REM > KWSAVE1
20 PRINT "saved program"
30 DEF FNprogName="KWSAVE2"
SAVE "KWSAVE"
SAVE FNprogName
SAVE
NEW
LOAD "KWSAVE"
LIST
RUN
NEW
LOAD "KWSAVE2"
LIST
NEW
10 ON ERROR PRINT ERR;" ";REPORT$:END
20 SAVE 3
RUN
*ERA KWSAVE.BBC
NEW
